A DLL mod that lets you cancel animations to dodge and block quickly, without waiting for the animation to end.

[size=4][b][color=#C0860A]W[/color][color=#C6901A]h[/color][color=#CD9B2A]a[/color][color=#D3A53A]t[/color] [color=#D9AF4A]d[/color][color=#E0BA5A]o[/color][color=#E6C46A]e[/color][color=#ECCE7A]s[/color] [color=#F3D98A]t[/color][color=#F3D98A]h[/color][color=#ECCE7A]i[/color][color=#E6C46A]s[/color] [color=#E0BA5A]m[/color][color=#D9AF4A]o[/color][color=#D3A53A]d[/color] [color=#CD9B2A]d[/color][color=#C6901A]o[/color][color=#C0860A]?[/color][/b][/size]
In Elden Ring, after you swing a weapon or use a skill, you have to wait for its animation to finish before you can dodge or guard. This DLL mod lets you cancel the animation of attacks, weapon arts, sorceries and incantations with a dodge, a guard, a jump or a weapon swap.

[size=3][b][color=#5DADE2]Cancel incantations with a dodge or a weapon swap[/color][/b][/size]
[img]https://i.postimg.cc/0NMZXW1j/AnimCancel-1.gif[/img]

[size=3][b][color=#5DADE2]Cancel weapon arts with a dodge or a guard[/color][/b][/size]
[img]https://i.postimg.cc/x812WJGP/Anim-Cancel-2.gif[/img]

[size=3][b][color=#5DADE2]Cancel attacks with a guard[/color][/b][/size]
[img]https://i.postimg.cc/0jV8Qd29/Anim-Cancel-3.gif[/img]

